&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miro is a fast-growing engineering organization building a business-critical collaboration platform used by companies around the world. As our product and infrastructure scale, we are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Network Site Reliability Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to help strengthen the reliability, availability, and scalability of our production environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will focus on cloud automation, Infrastructure as Code, network reliability, and operational excellence across our AWS infrastructure. You will help improve how we deploy, operate, observe, and govern cloud infrastructure at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With millions of users, a distributed team, and the support of outstanding VCs and advisors, it’s an incredible time to join Miro. Bring your skills, experience, and vision, so we can transform together how the world collaborates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Foundations &amp;amp; Network team is growing to support Miro’s cloud infrastructure at scale. The team focuses on building stable, reliable, secure, and highly available solutions in AWS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We own all Infrastructure-as-Code aspects and provide workflows to orchestrate automated solutions. We are also responsible for applying Governance policies and administration of our infrastructure resources on AWS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Miro, design is intrinsic in everything we do. As a business we are on a mission to redefine how great work is done, and as a design team we aim to make that as easy and delightful as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We operate in a fast-paced environment and get to have a direct impact on the millions of users who rely on Miro to collaborate and create the next big thing. As a part of our Product Design team, you will contribute to our design process, culture, and experience principles and set new standards for design quality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more about the colorful design team and our culture: https://miro.design/&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miro is looking for a visionary Staff&lt;strong&gt; Product Designer&lt;/strong&gt; to support the design of Miro’s &lt;strong&gt;canvas formats&lt;/strong&gt; experiences, including prototyping and slides. This isn’t just about refining a feature; it’s about defining the future of how millions of people bring their ideas to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a key leader within the Canvas Modes stream, you will lead the design evolution of these formats, helping Miro customers turn rough thinking and code-based content from in- and outside of Miro into polished, persuasive content on its canvas. We are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;AI Native designer &lt;/strong&gt;-&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;someone who doesn’t just see AI as a feature but as a fundamental shift in the product development process and ultimately, a massive opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be tasked with shaping not just where Miro’s formats offering should be, but where it is going - ensuring we aren&#39;t just keeping pace with the market, but setting it.&lt;/p&gt;
